			"Message": "style(Mist): Normalize README HTML formatting and self-closing tags\n\nReformat Mist README HTML to use explicit self-closing syntax on void elements (`<source>`, `<img>`), expand heading cells onto multiple lines, and simplify connector-cell spacing by reducing `&#x2001; + ` to a plain `+`.\n\nNo semantic content changes; purely structural reformatting.",
