			"Message": "chore(Mist): Advance Documentation/Rust submodule pointer\n\nUpdate the Documentation/Rust submodule from `fd168457` to `f50a4c0f`, picking up the latest Rust documentation commits for the Mist component.\n\nThis non-functional update keeps the checked-out documentation in sync with the repository's latest revisions.",
